  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the first-floor of Grosvenor House, 1 High Street, Edgware, Harrow, HA8 7TA as a Class (E) Office space is immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, the use of the first-floor space at Grosvenor House, 1 High Street, Edgware, Harrow, HA8 7TA, has been in use as offices under Class (E) for a continuous period of at least 10 years prior to the date of this application, on the balance of probability. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful and as such the Local Planning Authority refuse to issue a Certificate of Lawful Existing Development.&lt;/p&gt;"
